const PHRASES=[["late","Driver running late","kasni zakasnio zakasnjenje late delayed behind schedule missed eta pickup delivery driver vozac kasni","What is the confirmed ETA, and what caused the delay?",[["Broker","Quick","The driver is running behind schedule. I’m confirming his latest ETA and will update you shortly.","Vozač kasni. Potvrđujem novi ETA i javljam se uskoro."],["Broker","Professional","I wanted to give you an early heads-up: our driver is running behind. His current estimated arrival is [ETA]. I'll keep you updated if anything changes.","Želim da vas obavestim na vreme: vozač kasni, trenutni ETA je [ETA]."],["Broker","Firm","I understand the appointment is important. I'm verifying the driver's position before promising an arrival time. I'll send a confirmed update by [TIME].","Razumem važnost termina. Proveravam lokaciju pre nego što potvrdim dolazak."],["Broker","Request","Can you please check whether the facility can still receive him at approximately [ETA]? If not, what is the next available appointment?","Možete li proveriti prijem oko [ETA] ili sledeći termin?"],["Driver","Quick","Please send me your current location and your realistic ETA to the facility.","Pošalji trenutnu lokaciju i realan ETA."],["Driver","Professional","Please let me know what caused the delay, your current location, and whether you can legally make the updated appointment.","Javi razlog, lokaciju i da li legalno stižeš."],["Driver","Follow-up","If your ETA changes again, please let me know right away so I can update the broker.","Ako se ETA promeni, odmah javi."],["Broker","Follow-up","Quick follow-up: I'm still working on an accurate ETA and haven't received confirmation yet. My next update will be at [TIME].","Još nemam potvrdu. Sledeći update u [TIME]."]]],["traffic","Traffic / road closure","traffic guzva saobracaj zastoj road closed road closure accident detour kolona blokada","Is the traffic or closure verified?",[["Broker","Quick","The driver has reported traffic delays. I'll send an updated ETA once I confirm the impact.","Vozač je prijavio gužvu. Potvrđujem koliko utiče na ETA."],["Broker","Professional","There is a confirmed traffic delay on the driver's route. The estimated arrival is now [ETA]. We'll keep monitoring it.","Potvrđeno kašnjenje zbog gužve; novi ETA [ETA]."],["Broker","Request","Could you please let the facility know our ETA is [ETA] and check whether they'll still accept the truck?","Javite facility-ju i proverite prijem."],["Driver","Quick","Send me your exact location and updated ETA. Please drive safely.","Pošalji lokaciju i ETA, vozi bezbedno."],["Driver","Professional","Is the road fully closed or is traffic just slow? Please confirm before we reroute.","Da li je put zatvoren ili samo spor saobraćaj?"],["Broker","Follow-up","The truck is moving again. Current ETA is [ETA]. I'll notify you if it changes.","Kamion se ponovo kreće, ETA [ETA]."]]],["detention","Detention / long waiting","detention cekanje ceka dugo wait waiting hours dock istovar utovar 2 sata 3 sata","Do you have check-in time and written rate terms?",[["Broker","Quick","The driver has been checked in since [TIME] and is still waiting. Can you confirm detention terms?","Vozač čeka od [TIME]. Potvrdite detention uslove."],["Broker","Professional","Our driver checked in on time at [TIME] and remains at the facility. Please confirm when detention starts, the hourly rate, and written approval.","Potvrdite početak, cenu sata i odobrenje detention-a."],["Broker","Request","Please send an updated rate confirmation reflecting approved detention of [$AMOUNT].","Pošaljite izmenjen rate con sa odobrenim detention-om."],["Driver","Quick","Please send your check-in time, dock assignment and any signed paperwork.","Pošalji vreme prijave, rampu i dokumenta."],["Driver","Professional","Keep a record of your arrival, check-in, dock-in and departure times. Don't leave without the required paperwork.","Evidentiraj dolazak, prijavu, rampu i odlazak."],["Broker","Follow-up","Checking back on detention approval. The driver is still waiting and we need written confirmation of the amount.","Podsećam za potvrdu detention-a u pisanom obliku."]]],["breakdown","Breakdown / mechanical issue","breakdown broke broken kvar guma puncture engine battery tire repair mechanic tow service slep","Is the truck in a safe location and is the issue confirmed?",[["Broker","Quick","The driver has reported a mechanical issue. We're confirming the repair ETA now.","Vozač je prijavio kvar. Proveravamo ETA popravke."],["Broker","Professional","We have a confirmed equipment issue. The driver is in a safe location and we're arranging service. I'll update you once the repair timeline is confirmed.","Potvrđen kvar, vozač je na sigurnom, organizujemo servis."],["Broker","Request","If repairs delay delivery beyond [ETA], could you help us arrange the next available appointment?","Ako popravka odloži isporuku, tražimo novi termin."],["Driver","Quick","Are you in a safe location? What exactly failed? Send photos if possible.","Da li si bezbedan, šta se pokvarilo, pošalji slike."],["Driver","Professional","Please share the service provider, estimated repair time and whether the truck can move safely.","Pošalji servis, ETA popravke i da li može bezbedno da se kreće."],["Broker","Follow-up","Service is still in progress; a reliable repair ETA isn't available yet. I'll follow up at [TIME].","Servis traje, još nema pouzdanog ETA."]]],["hos","HOS / driver out of hours","hos hours clock log eld reset sleeper break legal rest 14 11 vreme sat pauza vozac sati driving","How much legal drive time is left?",[["Broker","Quick","I'm checking the driver's available legal hours before confirming the updated arrival.","Proveravam legalne sate vožnje pre potvrde ETA."],["Broker","Professional","The driver's remaining HOS affects our arrival window. We're recalculating a realistic ETA within applicable safety rules.","Preostali HOS utiče na dolazak, računamo legalan ETA."],["Broker","Request","Would the receiver be able to accommodate arrival at [ETA] after the required rest period?","Može li prijem nakon zakonskog odmora u [ETA]?"],["Driver","Quick","How much driving time and shift time do you have available on your ELD?","Koliko imaš drive i shift vremena na ELD-u?"],["Driver","Professional","Please send your available HOS and planned rest stop. Don't exceed your legal limits to make the appointment.","Pošalji HOS i plan pauze, bez prekoračenja."],["Broker","Follow-up","The updated ETA after required rest is [ETA]. We'll advise immediately if that changes.","Novi ETA nakon odmora je [ETA]."]]],["appointment","Missed / wrong appointment","appointment appt termin zakazano pogresno wrong missed reschedule late delivery pickup receiver shipper","What appointment is shown on the rate confirmation?",[["Broker","Quick","Our driver has an appointment discrepancy at the facility. Can you verify the correct time?","Na lokaciji se termini ne poklapaju. Proverite tačno vreme."],["Broker","Professional","The rate confirmation lists [TIME], but the facility is showing [OTHER TIME]. Please confirm the correct appointment in writing.","Rate con prikazuje [TIME], facility [OTHER TIME]. Potvrdite pismeno."],["Broker","Request","Can you assist with a revised appointment for [DATE/TIME] and send written confirmation?","Možete li pomeriti termin i poslati potvrdu?"],["Driver","Quick","Stay checked in and send me any appointment slip or information from the guard.","Ostani prijavljen i pošalji potvrdu od čuvara."],["Driver","Professional","Please confirm your check-in time and who you spoke to at the receiving office.","Potvrdi prijavu i sa kim si razgovarao."],["Broker","Follow-up","We're waiting on confirmation from the facility. Please advise whether the truck can be worked in today.","Čekamo facility potvrdu za prijem danas."]]],["pickup","Pickup number / shipper issue","pickup reference pu broj number not working shipper load not ready no load no pickup number gate utovar","Is the driver at the correct facility and checked in?",[["Broker","Quick","The driver is at pickup, but the reference number isn't being accepted. Can you verify it?","Vozač je na utovaru, broj nije prihvaćen."],["Broker","Professional","The driver checked in at [TIME]. The facility cannot locate the load under reference [NUMBER]. Please verify the PO/pickup number and advise.","Facility ne nalazi load pod brojem [NUMBER]."],["Broker","Request","Can you contact the shipper and send the correct pickup reference and loading instructions?","Kontaktirajte shipper i pošaljite tačan broj."],["Driver","Quick","Send me the exact facility address, reference number and what the guard told you.","Pošalji adresu, referencu i šta je guard rekao."],["Driver","Professional","Please wait safely at the designated area. Don't leave until we confirm the pickup status.","Sačekaj na bezbednom mestu dok ne potvrdimo status."],["Broker","Follow-up","The driver is still onsite. Any update from the shipping department?","Vozač je i dalje tu. Imate li update?"]]],["delivery","Delivery refused / receiver issue","delivery receiver rejected refusing refuse unload istovar problem odbija primalac problem delivery","What did the receiver state in writing?",[["Broker","Quick","The receiver is unable to unload the truck as scheduled. Can you check the issue?","Receiver ne može da istovari po planu. Proverite razlog."],["Broker","Professional","The driver is at delivery, but the facility is refusing or delaying unloading. We need written instructions before the truck can proceed.","Vozač je na istovaru; tražimo pismene instrukcije."],["Broker","Request","Please confirm disposition instructions and whether detention or layover will apply.","Potvrdite instrukcije i eventualni detention/layover."],["Driver","Quick","Stay onsite and send me exactly what the receiver said.","Ostani na lokaciji i pošalji šta su rekli."],["Driver","Professional","Take photos and request a written note of the rejection or discrepancy. Do not dispose of or redirect freight without authorization.","Dokumentuj odbijanje; ne menjaj odredište bez odobrenja."],["Broker","Follow-up","We're holding the freight pending written instructions. Please advise on the next step.","Teret čeka pismene instrukcije."]]],["lumper","Lumper fee / payment code","lumper fee payment efs comchek code unload cash fee payment istovar placanje","Is the fee amount and receipt confirmed?",[["Broker","Quick","The receiver is asking for a lumper fee of [$AMOUNT]. Can you provide a payment code?","Receiver traži lumper [$AMOUNT]; pošaljite kod."],["Broker","Professional","We have a lumper charge of [$AMOUNT]. Please confirm reimbursement or issue an EFS/Comchek code before payment.","Potvrdite povraćaj novca ili kod pre plaćanja."],["Broker","Request","Please add the approved lumper fee to the revised rate confirmation.","Dodajte odobren lumper na rate con."],["Driver","Quick","Send me the exact lumper amount and receipt or invoice.","Pošalji tačan iznos i račun."],["Driver","Professional","Please don't pay until we verify the payment method and reimbursement approval.","Nemoj da platiš dok ne potvrdimo način plaćanja."],["Broker","Follow-up","Following up on the lumper payment authorization; unloading is pending the payment code.","Čekamo kod za lumper, istovar stoji."]]],["layover","Layover / overnight wait","layover overnight tomorrow sutra overnight stay overnight wait overnight delay dock","Is the next appointment confirmed?",[["Broker","Quick","The appointment was moved to tomorrow. Can you confirm layover compensation?","Termin je pomeren za sutra, potvrdite layover."],["Broker","Professional","The truck will have to remain overnight due to the facility schedule. Please confirm the layover amount and send a revised rate confirmation.","Kamion čeka preko noći; potvrdite iznos pismeno."],["Broker","Request","Please approve [$AMOUNT] layover and confirm tomorrow's appointment at [TIME].","Odobrite layover i sutrašnji termin."],["Driver","Quick","Please keep your paperwork and confirm where you're parked.","Sačuvaj papire i javi gde si parkiran."],["Driver","Professional","Please document the reason for the delay, your check-in time and the new confirmed appointment.","Dokumentuj razlog i novi termin."],["Broker","Follow-up","We're still awaiting written layover approval and the revised rate confirmation.","Čekamo pisani layover approval."]]],["tonu","TONU / canceled load","tonu cancelled canceled cancel otkazano otkazivanje driver ordered unused ordered not used shipper","Was the truck dispatched and did it arrive?",[["Broker","Quick","The load was canceled after dispatch. Can you confirm TONU?","Load je otkazan posle dispatch-a. Potvrdite TONU."],["Broker","Professional","The driver was dispatched for this load and incurred travel/time costs before cancellation. Please confirm TONU eligibility and the approved amount in writing.","Vozač je krenuo pre otkazivanja; potvrdite iznos."],["Broker","Request","Please send a revised rate confirmation reflecting the agreed TONU of [$AMOUNT].","Pošaljite izmenjen rate con sa TONU."],["Driver","Quick","Send me your current location, arrival time if applicable, and any gate paperwork.","Pošalji lokaciju i dokumentaciju."],["Driver","Professional","Keep your dispatch instructions, timestamps and travel records so we can support the request.","Sačuvaj dispatch nalog i evidenciju."],["Broker","Follow-up","Following up on the TONU approval. Could you confirm the amount and payment terms?","Podsetnik za TONU iznos i uslove plaćanja."]]],["tracking","Tracking app / location issue","tracking macropoint trucker tools location gps link app not working disconnected pratiti pracenje lokacija","Did the driver accept the tracking request?",[["Broker","Quick","I'm checking the driver's tracking connection and will confirm shortly.","Proveravam tracking vezu."],["Broker","Professional","The driver has been asked to verify location permissions and reconnect to the tracking request. I'll confirm when it's active.","Vozač proverava dozvole i ponovo povezuje tracking."],["Broker","Request","Could you please resend the tracking link or invitation?","Možete li ponovo poslati tracking link?"],["Driver","Quick","Please reopen the tracking app and enable location permissions.","Otvori tracking i uključi lokaciju."],["Driver","Professional","Please verify location access is set to the required mode and confirm the tracking request was accepted.","Proveri location permission i zahtev."],["Broker","Follow-up","The driver is working on the connection. In the meantime, we can provide manual location updates.","Privremeno možemo davati ručne update-e."]]],["weight","Overweight / scaling","overweight heavy scale weight gross axle tandem 40k lbs kilograma tezina pretezak vaga","Do you have a scale ticket and axle weights?",[["Broker","Quick","The driver scaled the load and reported an overweight issue. We need to get the weights corrected.","Vaga pokazuje problem sa masom."],["Broker","Professional","The scale ticket indicates the load exceeds legal limits. The shipper may need to rework the freight. Please advise and confirm instructions.","Vaga pokazuje prekoračenje; treba preraspodela."],["Broker","Request","Can you contact the shipper to arrange rework and confirm any additional delay or compensation?","Kontaktirajte shipper za rework."],["Driver","Quick","Send a photo of the scale ticket showing gross and axle weights.","Pošalji vagu sa ukupnom i osovinskim težinama."],["Driver","Professional","Do not continue illegally overweight. Follow lawful instructions for adjustment and rescale.","Ne nastavljaj nezakonito pretežak."],["Broker","Follow-up","We're waiting for a legal loading plan and re-scale confirmation.","Čekamo legalan plan i novu vagu."]]],["weather","Weather / snow / high winds","weather snow ice wind rain storm blizzard sneg vetar led nevreme zaledjeno","Is the weather risk confirmed on the route?",[["Broker","Quick","Weather conditions are affecting the driver's progress. I'll send a realistic ETA once verified.","Vreme utiče na dolazak, javljam realan ETA."],["Broker","Professional","The driver has reported unsafe road conditions in the affected area. Safety is our priority; we will update the ETA when conditions allow.","Prijavljeni su nebezbedni uslovi; bezbednost je prioritet."],["Broker","Request","Would it be possible to move the appointment to [DATE/TIME] if conditions don't improve?","Možemo li pomeriti termin ako se vreme ne popravi?"],["Driver","Quick","Are road conditions safe? Where are you parked or moving?","Da li je bezbedno, gde si?"],["Driver","Professional","Please don't take risks to make the appointment. Send me a location and safe ETA when available.","Ne rizikuj zbog termina, javi bezbedan ETA."],["Broker","Follow-up","The driver remains in a safe location. I'll update you when the road conditions improve.","Vozač je na sigurnom, javljam promene."]]],["negotiation","Rate negotiation","rate price price negotiation offer money rpm quote bid number 2200 2500 cena broker cena niska vise para","What is your target all-in rate?",[["Broker","Quick","What's the best you can do on this load?","Koja je najbolja cena za load?"],["Broker","Professional","Considering the mileage, deadhead and delivery requirements, we'd need [$RATE] to make it work.","Sa ovim miljama i DH trebala bi nam cena [$RATE]."],["Broker","Firm","I have a truck ready to go, but at the current offer the numbers don't work. Can you meet us at [$RATE]?","Imam spreman kamion, ali cena nije dovoljna."],["Broker","Request","If you can approve [$RATE] all-in, I can confirm with the driver and get this moving.","Ako odobrite [$RATE], potvrdiću sa vozačem."],["Broker","Follow-up","Thanks for checking. Is there any flexibility left in the rate?","Da li ima još prostora u ceni?"],["Driver","Quick","What is your minimum acceptable rate on this lane?","Koji ti je minimalni prihvatljiv rate?"]]],["paperwork","BOL / POD / rate confirmation","bol pod paperwork proof of delivery documents rate con signed seal invoice papiri dokumenta papir rate confirmation","Which document is missing or incorrect?",[["Broker","Quick","Could you please resend the updated rate confirmation?","Pošaljite novi rate con."],["Broker","Professional","There is a discrepancy between the rate confirmation and the load instructions. Please send a corrected version before we proceed.","Rate con se ne poklapa sa instrukcijama."],["Broker","Request","Please confirm the required POD/BOL documentation and where it should be sent.","Potvrdite koja dokumenta i gde šaljemo."],["Driver","Quick","Please send clear pictures of all pages of the signed BOL/POD.","Pošalji jasne slike svih potpisanih strana."],["Driver","Professional","Please check that the receiver signed and noted any shortage or damage before leaving.","Proveri potpis i beleške o manjku/oštećenju."],["Broker","Follow-up","We've requested the signed paperwork from the driver and will forward it once received.","Tražili smo potpisane papire."]]],["damage","Damaged / missing cargo","damage damaged shortage missing freight rejected broken pallets cargo claim osteceno manjka roba","Is the discrepancy documented with photos?",[["Broker","Quick","The receiver has reported a cargo discrepancy. We're documenting it now.","Receiver prijavljuje problem sa robom."],["Broker","Professional","The receiver noted potential damage or shortage. The driver is documenting the condition, and we need written next-step instructions.","Primećen je manjak ili šteta, tražimo instrukcije."],["Broker","Request","Please confirm whether the receiver should note the exception on the POD and provide disposition instructions.","Potvrdite zapisnik i dalja uputstva."],["Driver","Quick","Take clear photos and request a written note on the paperwork.","Slikaj i traži pisanu napomenu."],["Driver","Professional","Do not discard, move or re-route the freight without authorized written instructions.","Ne odlaži i ne preusmeravaj robu bez pisanog odobrenja."],["Broker","Follow-up","We have documented the issue and are waiting on your written directions.","Dokumentovali smo, čekamo uputstva."]]],["reefer","Reefer temperature / breakdown","reefer temperature temp setpoint continuous frozen food cooler cooling fridge hladnjaca temperatura agregat","What temperature was specified on the rate confirmation?",[["Broker","Quick","Please verify the required temperature setting for this reefer load.","Potvrdite temperaturu za reefer."],["Broker","Professional","We're checking the reefer setpoint against the shipment instructions and documenting actual temperatures.","Proveravamo setpoint i stvarnu temperaturu."],["Broker","Request","Can you send written temperature requirements and any monitoring instructions?","Pošaljite pisana pravila temperature."],["Driver","Quick","Send me a picture of the reefer screen showing the setpoint and actual temperature.","Slikaj ekran agregata."],["Driver","Professional","Do not change the setpoint without verified written instructions. If the reefer unit is malfunctioning, stop safely and report immediately.","Ne menjaj temperaturu bez potvrde."],["Broker","Follow-up","The temperature settings are being verified; I will confirm the readings when available.","Proveravamo očitavanja."]]],["multi","Multiple stops / revised routing","multi stop stopoff stop off route redirect reconsignment additional stop destinacija stajanje multi","Has the revised route been authorized?",[["Broker","Quick","Can you confirm the updated stop sequence and appointment details?","Potvrdite novi redosled stopova."],["Broker","Professional","The routing instructions have changed. Please send a revised rate confirmation with all stops, mileage and agreed compensation.","Promenjena ruta; pošaljite novi rate con."],["Broker","Request","Can you approve additional compensation for the extra stop and mileage?","Odobrite dodatnu cenu za stop."],["Driver","Quick","Please don't change delivery locations until I confirm the written routing update.","Ne menjaj destinaciju bez potvrde."],["Driver","Professional","Send your current location and any new instructions received from the facility.","Pošalji lokaciju i nove instrukcije."],["Broker","Follow-up","Please confirm the revised route in writing so the driver can proceed correctly.","Potvrdite pisanu rutu."]]],["truck","Driver communication / check call","call driver no answer driver unreachable check call phone not responding not answering gde je vozac ne javlja se","When was the last confirmed driver update?",[["Broker","Quick","I'm reaching out to the driver and will update you as soon as I have confirmation.","Kontaktiram vozača i javljam čim potvrdi."],["Broker","Professional","I'm working to confirm the driver's current status. I don't want to provide an unverified location or ETA.","Potvrđujem status i neću slati neproverene informacije."],["Broker","Request","Would a written status update by [TIME] work for you?","Da li odgovara update do [TIME]?"],["Driver","Quick","Please call me when you get a chance. I need a quick status update.","Pozovi me, treba mi status."],["Driver","Professional","Please confirm your location, ETA, loaded/empty status and whether anything changed.","Potvrdi lokaciju, ETA i status."],["Broker","Follow-up","Still trying to reach the driver. I'll update you as soon as I get a confirmed status.","Još pokušavam da stupim u kontakt."]]],["empty","Empty truck / next load","empty available next load truck is empty ready reposition location trazi turu prazan kamion","Where is the truck empty and when is it ready?",[["Broker","Quick","I have an empty truck in [CITY, ST] ready to pick up. Is your load still available?","Prazan kamion u [CITY, ST], je li load dostupan?"],["Broker","Professional","Our truck is available in [CITY, ST] with approximately [DH] miles of deadhead. Can you share pickup details and your best all-in rate?","Kamion slobodan, DH [DH]. Tražim detalje i cenu."],["Broker","Request","Can you confirm weight, commodity, pickup appointment, delivery appointment, and any special requirements?","Potvrdite robu, težinu, termine i uslove."],["Driver","Quick","When will you be fully empty and ready for the next load?","Kada si prazan i spreman?"],["Driver","Professional","Please confirm your exact empty location, available HOS, equipment and preferred direction.","Potvrdi lokaciju, HOS, opremu i željeni smer."],["Broker","Follow-up","The truck is still available. Let me know if you can improve the rate and we'll review it right away.","Kamion je još dostupan."]]],["brokerpush","Broker upset / pressure","broker angry mad upset pressured demanding threatening complain broker ljut nervozan pritiska nezadovoljan","Do you have a confirmed fact to share?",[["Broker","Quick","I understand the urgency. Let me verify the latest details and get back to you.","Razumem hitnost; proveravam detalje."],["Broker","Professional","I understand your concern and I'm taking this seriously. I want to give you accurate information rather than an ETA I can't verify.","Razumem zabrinutost i želim da pružim tačne informacije."],["Broker","Firm","I can commit to a confirmed update by [TIME], but I don't want to promise something the driver cannot safely or legally do.","Mogu obećati update, ne nebezbednu vožnju."],["Broker","Request","Can we agree on the next update time while I coordinate with the driver?","Možemo li dogovoriti sledeći update?"],["Driver","Quick","Please send a confirmed status now; the customer needs an update.","Pošalji potvrđen status, kupac čeka."],["Broker","Follow-up","Here is the latest confirmed update: [FACT]. Current ETA: [ETA]. Next update: [TIME].","Poslednja potvrđena činjenica, ETA i sledeći update."]]]];
const CASES=[{"id":"overslept","name":"Driver overslept / late","keys":"uspavao se overslept zaspao kasni late driver broker ljut missed appointment","urgency":"High","facts":["Driver overslept","Current location confirmed?","Realistic ETA confirmed?"],"risk":"Missing an appointment, changing an ETA or going silent can trigger complaints. Do not invent traffic, breakdown or HOS.","plan":["Call driver and confirm whether he is safely moving, exact location and legal HOS.","Call broker proactively. Own the delay without volunteering personal details.","Offer a firm ETA or precise next update time; request a receiving window.","Follow up in writing and document the update."],"templates":[["Immediate / no ETA","I understand why you're frustrated, and I apologize for the delay. The driver is behind schedule. I'm confirming a realistic ETA right now, and I'll update you by [TIME].","Razumem da ste ljuti i izvinjavam se zbog kašnjenja. Potvrđujem realan ETA i javljam do [TIME]."],["With ETA","You're right to expect an on-time delivery. We missed the schedule, and I take that seriously. The driver's latest confirmed ETA is [ETA]. Can you help us confirm whether the receiver can still work him in?","U pravu ste da očekujete tačnu isporuku. Propušten je termin, ETA je [ETA]. Možete li proveriti prijem?"],["Broker is angry","I understand your concern. I don't want to make excuses or give you another unreliable time. Here is what I can confirm: [FACT]. Next update: [TIME]. I'm working on the receiving options now.","Razumem zabrinutost. Neću iznositi izgovore ni nepouzdana vremena. Potvrđeno je [FACT], sledeći update [TIME]."],["Written follow-up","Following up on our call: our truck is running behind, and our current ETA is [ETA]. We apologize for the disruption and will notify you immediately if anything changes.","Nastavak razgovora: kamion kasni, ETA [ETA]. Izvinjavamo se i javljamo promene."]]},{"id":"cancel","name":"Booked load, need to cancel","keys":"otkazem otkazati bukovao book booked bolja tura more money better load cancel load fall off freightguard kvar laz","urgency":"High","facts":["Has the rate con been signed?","Has the driver been dispatched?","Can your carrier still honor the load?"],"risk":"Canceling a committed load for a better rate is commercially risky. Do not claim a false breakdown; offer fast notice and help with recovery.","plan":["Before booking another load, check whether the first commitment can still be honored.","If you cannot cover it, inform the broker immediately rather than waiting for pickup.","State you cannot fulfill the commitment without inventing a mechanical failure.","Offer load reposting/recovery support and written confirmation of cancellation."],"templates":[["Early cancellation","I'm calling to give you a heads-up as soon as possible: unfortunately, we're no longer able to cover load [LOAD ID]. I realize this creates a problem on your end, and I sincerely apologize for the inconvenience.","Zovem da vam odmah javim da nećemo moći da pokrijemo load. Razumem da ovo pravi problem i izvinjavam se."],["Take responsibility","I understand you were counting on our truck, and I know this puts you in a difficult position. This is a dispatch issue on our end, and I wanted to be upfront with you rather than leave you scrambling at the last minute.","Znam da ste računali na naš kamion. Ovo je naš dispatch problem i zato odmah javljam."],["Offer a recovery plan","I don't want to leave you in a bind. If it helps, I can provide an immediate written cancellation and stay available to coordinate a smooth handoff while you arrange replacement capacity.","Ne želim da vas ostavim u problemu; mogu da pomognem oko primopredaje i zamenskog kamiona."],["Broker is upset","I completely understand your frustration, and I'm not going to argue with you about it. We made a commitment that we can't honor, and I take responsibility. I wanted to tell you immediately so you have the best possible chance to recover the load.","Razumem ljutnju i neću se raspravljati. Preuzimamo odgovornost i javljamo odmah radi brze zamene."],["If broker asks why","We made a dispatch decision that means we won't be able to honor the original commitment. That's on us. I'm sorry for the disruption, and I want to be transparent so we can handle the cancellation properly.","Doneli smo dispatch odluku zbog koje ne možemo da ispoštujemo obavezu; to je naša odgovornost."],["Request release","Would you be willing to release us from load [LOAD ID] and confirm the cancellation in writing? I understand this is short notice, and I appreciate your consideration.","Da li možete da nas oslobodite ove ture i potvrdite otkazivanje napismeno?"],["Short text","Hi [NAME], unfortunately we can't cover load [LOAD ID] as booked. I apologize for the inconvenience and wanted to notify you immediately. Please confirm receipt.","Nažalost ne možemo da vozimo bukirani load. Izvinjavam se i javljam odmah, potvrdite prijem."],["Written confirmation","As discussed, we're unable to service load [LOAD ID]. This email confirms our notice of cancellation at [TIME]. We apologize for the disruption and are available to assist with a smooth handoff.","Kao što smo razgovarali, nismo u mogućnosti da vozimo turu. Ovim potvrđujemo vreme otkazivanja."]]},{"id":"noanswer","name":"Driver not answering","keys":"ne javlja unreachable phone no answer missing driver check call broker angry","urgency":"High","facts":["When was last verified contact?","Is tracking active?","Do you have a verified last location?"],"risk":"Do not pretend to know the driver's location or status.","plan":["Call driver and backup contact using normal procedures.","Check authorized tracking only.","Share the last confirmed information with the broker and set a follow-up time.","Escalate appropriately if there is a genuine safety concern."],"templates":[["Status request","I'm working to get a confirmed update from the driver. I don't have a verified new ETA yet, so I'd rather follow up by [TIME] than give you an incorrect time.","Čekam potvrđen update od vozača. Javljam najkasnije do [TIME]."],["Broker upset","I understand this is frustrating. The last confirmed status was [FACT] at [TIME]. I'm working on a current update and will call you by [TIME].","Poslednji potvrđen status je [FACT] u [TIME]. Sledeći update do [TIME]."],["Written","We are verifying the driver's current location and ETA. Last confirmed update: [FACT]. Next update by [TIME].","Proveravamo lokaciju i ETA. Poslednje potvrđeno [FACT]."]]},{"id":"pickup","name":"Driver will miss pickup","keys":"pickup miss kasni utovar appointment missed shipper","urgency":"High","facts":["Current ETA?","Pickup appointment confirmed?","Shipper cutoff time?"],"risk":"Early notice and a workable revised appointment usually matter more than a detailed story.","plan":["Confirm realistic arrival and check-in cutoff.","Warn broker early, with the revised ETA.","Ask for reschedule or work-in availability.","Get revised instructions in writing."],"templates":[["Early heads-up","Our driver is running behind for pickup. I'm working with him to confirm ETA, and I wanted to flag this early. Can you check whether the shipper can still work him in?","Vozač kasni na pickup; javljam na vreme i pitam da li će ga primiti."],["Confirmed ETA","The updated pickup ETA is [ETA]. Please let us know if the appointment can be moved or if we should follow another check-in procedure.","Novi ETA [ETA]. Može li se pomeriti termin?"],["Follow-up","Can you confirm the next available pickup appointment and whether the load is still available for our truck?","Potvrdite sledeći termin i da li je load još naš."]]},{"id":"breakdown","name":"Real mechanical breakdown","keys":"mechanical broke breakdown kvar guma engine repair truck down","urgency":"High","facts":["Confirmed mechanical problem?","Driver in safe location?","Repair ETA? "],"risk":"Only use breakdown explanations if you have a real reported mechanical issue.","plan":["Confirm driver safety and breakdown details.","Obtain service provider and repair estimate.","Inform broker promptly with verified facts.","Coordinate recovery or rescheduling as needed."],"templates":[["Initial","Our driver has reported a mechanical issue. We're confirming the repair timeline and will give you an updated plan by [TIME].","Vozač je prijavio kvar. Proveravamo vremenski plan popravke."],["With repair ETA","The truck has a confirmed mechanical problem, and the current repair estimate is [TIME]. Please advise whether the delivery appointment can be adjusted.","Potvrđen kvar; procena završetka popravke [TIME]."],["Recovery","If the repair timeline changes, we'll review available recovery options and communicate the plan right away.","Ako popravka potraje, proveravamo opcije za završetak ture."]]},{"id":"hos","name":"Not enough legal driving hours","keys":"hos out of hours eld legal reset sleeper driver cannot make delivery","urgency":"High","facts":["Available drive and shift time?","Valid restart/split?","Realistic ETA after required rest?"],"risk":"Never instruct the driver to falsify logs or continue driving illegally.","plan":["Verify ELD and remaining lawful hours.","Recalculate arrival with required rest.","Notify broker and request revised appointment.","Avoid promising times incompatible with HOS."],"templates":[["Immediate","I'm verifying the driver's remaining legal hours and will send a realistic ETA shortly.","Proveravam preostale legalne sate i šaljem realan ETA."],["With ETA","The driver's available HOS requires a revised arrival time of [ETA]. Can the facility accept the truck then?","HOS zahteva dolazak u [ETA]. Može li prijem?"],["Firm","I understand the deadline, but we cannot compromise legal driving hours. I can provide our updated safe ETA and work on a new appointment.","Razumem rok, ali ne možemo prekršiti HOS."]]},{"id":"rate","name":"Broker rate dispute / missing pay","keys":"rate payment detention invoice pay broker refuses rate con short paid claim fee","urgency":"Medium","facts":["Signed rate confirmation?","Written approval?","Supporting timestamps or documents?"],"risk":"Keep records, be factual, and do not threaten without understanding your agreement.","plan":["Review rate con and supporting documents.","State the disputed amount and evidence.","Request revised rate con or written approval.","Escalate through normal invoicing/dispute process."],"templates":[["Request","Could you help me reconcile the amount on the rate confirmation with the approved accessorials? Our supporting documents show [FACT].","Pomozite da uskladimo rate con i odobrene dodatke."],["Firm","We'd like to resolve this directly. Please confirm the approved amount of [$AMOUNT] in writing so we can invoice accurately.","Želimo da rešimo direktno; potvrdite iznos pismeno."],["Follow-up","Just following up on the outstanding approval. Can you provide a status update by [TIME]?","Podsećam na odobrenje; možete li poslati status do [TIME]?"]]},{"id":"rejected","name":"Receiver refuses freight","keys":"rejected refused damaged shortage delivery receiver not accepting freight","urgency":"High","facts":["What was refused?","Photos and note on BOL?","Disposition instructions?"],"risk":"Do not abandon freight or deviate without written instructions.","plan":["Have driver document the refusal.","Request instructions from broker/customer.","Secure freight and await authorized disposition.","Document detention and any extra costs."],"templates":[["Initial","The receiver is not accepting the freight. We're collecting the written reason and need disposition instructions.","Receiver odbija robu. Tražimo pisani razlog i instrukcije."],["Request","Please confirm whether we should hold at the facility or move to an authorized location, and who will cover additional costs.","Potvrdite gde da čekamo i ko pokriva troškove."],["Follow-up","The driver is holding the freight pending written instructions. Please advise as soon as possible.","Vozač čuva robu i čeka pismene instrukcije."]]},{"id":"tonu","name":"Canceled by shipper / TONU","keys":"tonu load cancel shipper canceled ordered not used compensation","urgency":"Medium","facts":["Was the truck dispatched?","Arrival and time records?","TONU policy?"],"risk":"TONU isn't automatic; request support from written terms and actual work done.","plan":["Preserve records of dispatch and arrival.","Ask for written cancellation and TONU terms.","Document approved compensation.","Send revised invoice or rate con request."],"templates":[["Request","Our truck was dispatched before the load was canceled. Can you confirm TONU eligibility and the amount in writing?","Kamion je krenuo pre otkazivanja. Potvrdite TONU pismeno."],["Follow-up","Can you send the agreed TONU on an updated rate confirmation so we can invoice correctly?","Pošaljite TONU na izmenjenom rate con-u."],["Documentation","We can provide dispatch and arrival records if needed to support the request.","Možemo poslati dispatch i arrival evidenciju."]]},{"id":"tracking","name":"Tracking not updating","keys":"tracking location macropoint trucker tools gps unavailable link driver app","urgency":"Medium","facts":["Tracking invitation received?","Driver consent and location permissions?","Last known valid update?"],"risk":"Do not fabricate tracking statuses.","plan":["Verify tracking setup and permissions.","Ask broker to resend link if needed.","Provide verified manual status updates during outage.","Confirm once tracking resumes."],"templates":[["Initial","I'm checking the tracking connection with the driver. We'll provide a confirmed manual update while it's being resolved.","Proveravam tracking, privremeno šaljemo ručni update."],["Request","Could you resend the tracking invitation? I'll have the driver reconnect.","Pošaljite ponovo tracking pozivnicu."],["Follow-up","Tracking is being restored. Last confirmed location: [FACT]. Next update by [TIME].","Tracking se vraća; poslednja potvrđena lokacija [FACT]."]]},{"id":"detention","name":"Waiting at shipper / detention","keys":"detention wait hours waiting dock no door loading unload cekanje dugo","urgency":"Medium","facts":["Check-in and check-out times?","Rate con terms?","Approval in writing?"],"risk":"Do not invent wait times or assume detention is approved.","plan":["Confirm documented check-in/out times.","Check rate confirmation detention terms.","Request approval before invoicing.","Keep broker updated."],"templates":[["Initial","The driver checked in at [TIME] and is still waiting. Can you check the facility status?","Vozač čeka od [TIME]. Proverite status."],["Request","Could you confirm when detention starts and the approved hourly amount?","Potvrdite početak i cenu detention-a."],["Firm","We've documented the wait and would appreciate written detention approval on the revised rate confirmation.","Dokumentovali smo čekanje; tražimo pisano odobrenje."]]},{"id":"late","name":"Driver running late / ETA issue","keys":"kasni late behind delayed delivery arrival appointment driver eta broker upset time","urgency":"High","facts":["Exact truck location and driver status?","Verified updated ETA?","Can receiver work the driver in?"],"risk":"Don't assume or invent a reason for the delay; provide confirmed information and a concrete next update.","plan":["Verify location, available HOS and a realistic ETA.","Notify the broker promptly and acknowledge the missed timing.","Ask about work-in or rescheduling options and follow up in writing."],"templates":[["First update","I wanted to let you know before this becomes a bigger issue: our driver is running behind. I'm confirming his actual ETA now and will update you by [TIME].","Javljam ranije da vozač kasni. Potvrđujem ETA i šaljem update do [TIME]."],["Apology and plan","I understand the schedule matters, and I'm sorry we're behind. Our latest confirmed ETA is [ETA]. Could you check whether the receiver can still accommodate us?","Znam da je termin bitan. Novi ETA je [ETA]; može li nas receiver primiti?"],["Broker is upset","I hear you, and I understand why you're frustrated. I'm not going to give you an ETA I can't verify. I'll send you a confirmed location and time by [TIME].","Razumem frustraciju; neću dati neproveren ETA, već tačan update do [TIME]."],["Short text","Quick update: we're running behind schedule. Confirming ETA now; next update by [TIME]. Sorry for the inconvenience.","Kratak update: kasnimo, potvrđujem ETA, sledeće javljanje do [TIME]."],["Follow-up","Following up on our call: the current verified ETA is [ETA]. I'll keep you informed of any changes and coordinate the receiving appointment if needed.","Nastavak razgovora: potvrđen ETA je [ETA], javljamo sve promene."],["No confirmed reason","I don't have a verified explanation for the delay yet, and I don't want to speculate. What I can confirm is [FACT], and my next update will be by [TIME].","Još nemam potvrđen razlog i neću nagađati. Potvrđeno je [FACT]."]]}];
